############################
# Local-dev-only module symlinks (Composer path repositories)
############################

# block_layout_accordion is developed as its own project at
# ~/sites/block_layout_accordion and pulled in here via a Composer path
# repository/symlink for fast local iteration. That symlink is specific to
# this machine and must never be committed — deploy gets the module from a
# real drupal.org release once one exists, same as every other contrib
# module in this repo.
/web/modules/contrib/block_layout_accordion

